SE logic, loops, and delaysDynamic CRM variablesDetailed execution logs🧠AI & Alexandria (RAG)Knowledge base with Retrieval-Augmented Generation. Answers with real company context, not generic chatbot responses.Real-time response suggestionsCustomer sentiment analysisDeal closing probability scoreAutomatic conversation summaries📊Full CRM + PipelineLead, contact, and opportunity management with visual pipeline, drag-and-drop stages, and full interaction history.Auto-deduplication by email/phoneActivity-based lead scoringAutomatic forecastingCustomizable fields per account📈Analytics & ReportsExecutive dashboard with real-time KPIs, activity heatmaps, cohort analysis, and CSV/Excel/PDF exports.Conversion rate by funnel stageRep performance rankingCampaign ROI metricsScheduled email reportsReady-to-use automationsWorkflows that run while you sleepPre-built automation templates. Just configure and activate.AcquisitionAutomatic lead follow-upLead created → WhatsApp 5 min → email 2h → SMS 1 day → mark "cold" if no replyRecoveryAbandoned cartWebhook → WhatsApp + coupon → 6h no purchase → email → 1 day → free shipping offerExpansionPost-close upsellDeal won → related products → email + WhatsApp → follow-up task in 7 daysRetentionAutomatic NPSSupport resolved → 2h → NPS via WhatsApp → score <7 escalates to managerRe-engagementCold lead (60 days silent)Auto trigger → "still interested?" → replied: active / silence: mark inactiveRelationshipBirthday offerDaily cron → detects birthdays → "Happy birthday + 15% off" + task for manager to callHow it worksLive in minutes, not weeks01Create your accountGuided setup. Nothing to install. 100% cloud.02Connect your channelsWhatsApp via QR Code, email, Instagram in a few clicks.03Import your leadsCSV, API, or migrate from Kommo automatically.04Activate automationsPick a ready template or build yours in the visual editor.IntegrationsWorks with your existing stackWhatsApp BusinessEvolution APIInstagram DMGmailFacebook MessengerZapierMakeGoog